<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44127" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθῠ-ωρία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>straight course</i> or
				<i>direction</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				436e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ti.</u>
				45c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>de An.</u>
				406b31
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ εὐθυωρίαν</span>
			<i>longitudinally</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>PA</u>
				654a17
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντικροῦσαι κατ᾽
			εὐ</span>. to oppose <i>directly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1379a11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ εὐ. νοῆσθαι</span>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ ἀναλογίαν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ti.Locr.
				94b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπειρα εἰς εὐ</span>. <i>in
				an</i> infinite <i>series</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				994a2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθυωρίᾳ ἐπὶ θάλασσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					685.65
				</span></i>
			 (Itanos, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), cf. ib.<i><span class="en">
				421.48
			</span></i> (Thermon, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀν
				εὐθυωρείαν</span> (sic) <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tab.Heracl.</u>
				1.65
			</span></i>; also <i><span class="en">
				Arc.
			</span></i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθυορϝίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BCH</u>
					39.55
				</span></i>
			 (Orchom. <i><span class="en">
				Arc.
			</span></i>, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰθυωρίη</span>.</div>
